Package: MLP
Title: Musical Learning Protocol (DELTA-M) for psychTestR
Version: 0.9.0
Authors@R:
    person("Anton", email = "das.schreiberle@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implementation of the Musical Learning Protocol (MLP), a teacher
    rating of instrumental pupils with criterion-, norm- and
    individual-referenced levels. Based on the psychTestR library. Split off
    from the 'psyquest' package so that it can be installed independently.
